#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:5 d3169129b65c49dfaf3ed43f96230312
msgid "MANUAL Mode"
msgstr "MANUAL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:7 85cff66aa3914784aaef93ef5b9073f8
msgid ""
"Regular RC control, no stabilization. All RC inputs are passed through to "
"the servo outputs set by their SERVOx_FUNCTION."
msgstr "普通遥控控制，无稳定。所有 RC 输入直接传递到由 SERVOx_FUNCTION 设置的舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:10 b14916ffb3f246bab23ad52cbb168d41
msgid ""
"the :ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>`, and "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` parameters will apply exponential to"
" the stick inputs, if non-zero, in this mode. This is for users with "
"transmitters which do not provide this function and desire to \"soften\" "
"stick feel around neutral."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`、:ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>` 和 "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` "
"参数如果非零，将在此模式下对摇杆输入应用指数，供遥控器不具备此功能但希望在中位附近「软化」摇杆感受的用户使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-mode.rst:12 3056e12a11994d6caa1b1f5b4128596b
msgid ""
"This assumes that the RC channel is being used as a servo output function "
"instead of one selected by its RCx_OPTION parameter. The only ways in which "
"the input to a servo output function may be different from inputs in this "
"mode is if a configured failsafe or geofence triggers, and Plane takes "
"control."
msgstr ""
"这假设 RC 通道用作舵机输出功能，而不是由其 RCx_OPTION "
"参数选择的功能。在此模式下，舵机输出功能的输入与手动模式输入不同的唯一情况是配置的失控保护或地理围栏触发，Plane 接管控制。"
